# Saans font binaries: licensed, never redistributed to third parties. The
# variable face is synced locally via scripts/sync-font.mjs from the private
# cam-profile repo; the Mono trial faces are a Displaay trial download. Code
# that @font-face's them is committed, the binaries never are.
/public/fonts/SaansVF.woff2
/public/fonts/Saans-Mono/
/public/fonts/Saans-SemiMono/
